/**
 * CareersPage — faithful to Stitch design (careers_kismet_foods).
 *
 * Sections:
 *   1. Hero           — large serif headline, italic accent, editorial side image,
 *                       "Global Footprint" floating card, CTAs to openings + philosophy.
 *   2. Culture DNA    — "Our DNA" eyebrow + 3 value cards on a pale band.
 *   3. Life at Kismet — Bento grid: large hero shot + benefit tiles + portrait tile
 *                       + testimonial quote card + lab QC tile (4th Stitch image).
 *   4. Open roles     — Numbered list of 4 role categories with Apply CTAs.
 *   5. Final CTA      — "careers@kismetfoods.com" gradient band.
 *
 * All 4 Stitch images on the source page are used:
 *   · Hero portrait   (team in office)
 *   · Life main       (open-plan office)
 *   · Small portrait  (diverse professionals in lounge)
 *   · Lab shot        (hand inspecting raw coffee beans)
 */
